{"id":"639add8a9da27359","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth.md","title":"全类型外部语义中的真值对应","display":"thm-modified-realizability-full-truth — 全类型外部语义中的真值对应","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth","aliases":["72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth"],"display":"thm-modified-realizability-full-truth — 全类型外部语义中的真值对应","depends_on":["[[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §§3.3(i),3.4, print430–431/PDF442–443; local ZFC consequence, not an internal extraction theorem","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modified-realizability-full-truth — 全类型外部语义中的真值对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5341a0bc9ba0e23a\" href=\"?note=5341a0bc9ba0e23a\" title=\"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model\">72-df-modified-realizability-full-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §§3.3(i),3.4, print430–431/PDF442–443; local ZFC consequence, not an internal extraction theorem"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5341a0bc9ba0e23a\" href=\"?note=5341a0bc9ba0e23a\" title=\"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model\">72-df-modified-realizability-full-model</a> 的全类型集合结构及实现性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal M_a\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal M_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；元理论为含选择公理的 ZFC。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists r\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\ \\operatorname{MR}(r,A,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists r\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\ \\operatorname{MR}(r,A,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按公式同时归纳两个方向。原子、合取、存在直接使用真值子句及配对。蕴涵反向：前件真则归纳给前件实现者，应用后得到后件真。蕴涵正向：若后件真，选其一个实现者作常函数；若前件假，任一默认全函数都满足空的前件条件。全称正向对每个自然数的非空实现者集合用可数选择，形成类型正确的全函数；反向逐点展开。该结果展示选用全集合函数模型的后果；不推出可计算见证，也不把外部经典真值等同于 HA 内部可证性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model","status":"resolved","id":"5341a0bc9ba0e23a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modified-realizability-full-model","status":"resolved","id":"5341a0bc9ba0e23a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] 的全类型集合结构及实现性；$A\\in\\mathcal M_a$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$；元理论为含选择公理的 ZFC。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal M_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists r\\in\\mathcal D_{\\operatorname{rt}(A)}\\ \\operatorname{MR}(r,A,\\eta).","display":true}],"bytes":1824,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizabi